<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<body>

<main class="page-header">
  <h1>Welcome to the Farm Shop</h1>
  <p>Now the home page is clean, bright and focused on farming introduction. Use the navigation bar to explore products by category, or visit the All Products page to see every item together.</p>

  <div class="card-row">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Organized categories</h3>
      <p>Each section shows only that product type, so pesticide products appear on the Pesticide page and fertilizer products appear on the Fertilizer page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Fresh green style</h3>
      <p>Light green backgrounds make the shop easy on the eyes and keep the farm theme gentle and pleasant.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Browse everything</h3>
      <p>Use the All Products page to see every item from the database in one place, with a calm, unified design.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:28px;">
    <a href="/all-products" class="action-link">Browse all products</a>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
